    "homepage": "https://wordpress.org/themes/fire-brigade/",
    "sections": {
        "description": "The Fire Brigade theme is designed for organizations and emergency response teams involved in fire safety, rescue operations, and public protection services. It includes structured layouts for service information, emergency contact details, campaign sections, team profiles, and response updates. The responsive design helps the website function smoothly across desktops, tablets, and mobile devices. Customization options allow adjustments to colors, typography, banners, and page layouts while maintaining a clear and professional appearance. The theme also supports image galleries, blog sections, and call-to-action areas for sharing safety awareness programs and emergency preparedness information. Suitable for a fire brigade department, rescue service, firefighter organization, or emergency response agency, the layout provides a practical framework for presenting fire extinguisher services, danger awareness campaigns, rescue operations, and public help resources in an accessible format."
    },
